    StoreToken --> Redirect[Redirect to Dashboard<br/>/dashboard]
    
    Redirect --> CheckRole{Frontend<br/>Role Check}
    
    CheckRole -->|role !== 'admin'| NoAccess[❌ No Admin Access<br/>Standard dashboard shown]
    
    CheckRole -->|role === 'admin'| AdminAccess[✅ Admin Access Granted]
    
    AdminAccess --> AdminPanel[Admin Panel Available<br/>Navigation shows admin links]
    
    AdminPanel --> Routes{Choose Admin Route}
    
    Routes -->|Users| UserMgmt[User Management<br/>/admin/users<br/>• View all users<br/>• Create/edit/delete<br/>• Reset passwords]
    
    Routes -->|Settings| SysSettings[System Settings<br/>/admin/settings<br/>• Site configuration<br/>• Maintenance mode<br/>• Feature toggles]
    
    Routes -->|Analytics| Analytics[Analytics Dashboard<br/>/admin/analytics<br/>• User growth<br/>• Project stats<br/>• Engagement metrics]
    
    Routes -->|Security| Security[Security Logs<br/>/admin/security<br/>• Activity logs<br/>• Audit trail<br/>• IP tracking]
    
    Routes -->|User Details| UserDetail[User Details<br/>/admin/users/:userId<br/>• Full profile<br/>• Edit details<br/>• View activity]
    
    UserMgmt --> APICall[Frontend Makes API Call<br/>with Authorization header]
    SysSettings --> APICall
    Analytics --> APICall
    Security --> APICall
    UserDetail --> APICall
    
    APICall --> BackendAuth{Backend Verifies<br/>JWT Token}
    
    BackendAuth -->|Invalid Token| Unauthorized[❌ 401 Unauthorized<br/>Redirect to login]
    
    BackendAuth -->|Valid Token| RoleCheck{check_admin()<br/>Verifies role}
    
    RoleCheck -->|Not Admin| Forbidden[❌ 403 Forbidden<br/>Access denied]
    
    RoleCheck -->|Is Admin| Execute[✅ Execute Admin Action<br/>Query database<br/>Return data]
    
    Execute --> Response[Send Response to Frontend]
    
    Response --> Display[Display Data in UI<br/>User can interact]
    
    Display --> MoreActions{More Admin<br/>Actions?}
    
    MoreActions -->|Yes| Routes
    MoreActions -->|No| Done([Admin Session Active<br/>Token valid for 24h])
    
    NoAccess --> Fix{Fix Access<br/>Issue}
    
    Fix -->|Update Role| UpdateSQL[UPDATE users<br/>SET role = 'admin'<br/>WHERE email = '...']
    UpdateSQL --> Relogin[Logout and Login Again]
    Relogin --> Login
    
    Fix -->|Check Token| ClearCache[Clear Browser Cache<br/>localStorage.clear()]
    ClearCache --> Login
    
    Unauthorized --> Login
    Forbidden --> Fix

